(OppRadar - Software Requirements Specification \(SRS\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Status: placeholder. Replace with the real SRS export.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Overview) Tj T*
(   OppRadar ingests opportunities \(internships, jobs, scholarships,) Tj T*
(   competitions, bootcamps\), checks them for scams, matches them to user) Tj T*
(   CVs, and answers questions about them through a chat assistant.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Actors) Tj T*
(   - Visitor: browses and searches opportunities.) Tj T*
(   - Registered user: uploads a CV, gets matches, chats with the assistant.) Tj T*
(   - Admin: manages sources, reviews flagged \(scam\) entries.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Functional requirements) Tj T*
(   FR1 Ingest opportunities from configured sources on a schedule.) Tj T*
(   FR2 Extract structured fields \(title, org, deadline, type...\).) Tj T*
(   FR3 De-duplicate and score scam risk for every opportunity.) Tj T*
(   FR4 Parse an uploaded CV into a structured profile.) Tj T*
(   FR5 Rank opportunities per profile with explanations.) Tj T*
(   FR6 Answer user questions grounded in real, indexed opportunities.) Tj T*
(   FR7 Real-time progress updates over WebSocket.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Non-functional requirements) Tj T*
(   NFR1 Answers must cite only indexed opportunities \(no hallucination\).) Tj T*
(   NFR2 Secrets live only in environment variables, never in the repo.) Tj T*
(   NFR3 Users see only their own data \(Postgres row-level security\).) Tj T*
(   NFR4 Ingestion failures are isolated per source.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
